25,2,1,talk,Servas,,"It seems our reporting process is burdened by physical assets. Software is easier to track, but hardware provides more transparency.","{""words"":20,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
26,2,1,talk,Asuka,,"Interestingly, back-office financial tools have been our most successful exits, while operational businesses with physical premises failed.","{""words"":17,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
27,2,1,talk,Minako,,"We are spending reserves on follow-ons much faster than planned, and our credit line doesn't value subscription contracts.","{""words"":18,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
28,2,1,talk,Mio,,"We have plenty of software board capacity, but finding people for physical operations is taking way too long.","{""words"":18,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
29,2,1,talk,Toshio,,Security reviews for medical or financial data are significantly slower than for other types of software.,"{""words"":16,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
30,2,2,talk,Servas,,"@Minako, if the credit line ignores subscriptions, we must be careful about the cash flow of our next pick.","{""words"":19,""mentions"":[""Minako""],""raw_differs"":false}"
31,2,2,talk,Asuka,,"@Toshio, does that security delay apply to all financial tools, or just specific sectors?","{""words"":14,""mentions"":[""Toshio""],""raw_differs"":false}"
32,2,2,talk,Minako,,"@Servas, exactly. We need a company that doesn't drain our reserves immediately or require unbacked borrowing.","{""words"":16,""mentions"":[""Servas""],""raw_differs"":false}"
33,2,2,talk,Mio,,"@Asuka, if physical premises are a risk, maybe we should avoid anything with a warehouse?","{""words"":15,""mentions"":[""Asuka""],""raw_differs"":false}"
34,2,2,talk,Toshio,,"@Asuka, it is specifically medical records and money-holding entities that cause the three-quarter delay.","{""words"":14,""mentions"":[""Asuka""],""raw_differs"":false}"
35,2,3,talk,Servas,,"@Mio, your point about staffing is crucial. If we can't hire for the role, the company stalls.","{""words"":17,""mentions"":[""Mio""],""raw_differs"":false}"
36,2,3,talk,Asuka,,"@Toshio, thank you. So a general ledger tool might be faster to deploy than a medical one.","{""words"":17,""mentions"":[""Toshio""],""raw_differs"":false}"
37,2,3,talk,Minako,,We should prioritize a model that is lean on physical overhead and doesn't trigger early follow-on calls.,"{""words"":17,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
38,2,3,talk,Mio,,I agree! Let's look for something that doesn't need a huge field crew or a warehouse manager.,"{""words"":17,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
39,2,3,talk,Toshio,,I am also wary of hardware. My research shows device shortages can cause massive delivery delays.,"{""words"":16,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
